i-Sustain build for Joy.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy#build-jungle-anti-sustain\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T8b4,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Joy in Mobile Legends: EXP Sustain Duel\",\"description\":\"EXP lane setup for dueling and second-entry fights where Joy needs sustain, shield value, and enough magic damage to threaten the backline.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Concentrated Energy\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Vengeance Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the EXP Sustain Duel build for Joy.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy#build-exp-sustain-duel\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Genius Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Genius Wand (2,000 gold) as item 2 in the EXP Sustain Duel build for Joy.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy#build-exp-sustain-duel\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Concentrated Energy\",\"text\":\"Purchase Concentrated Energy (2,020 gold) as item 3 in the EXP Sustain Duel build for Joy.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy#build-exp-sustain-duel\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Oracle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Oracle (1,860 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Sustain Duel build for Joy.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy#build-exp-sustain-duel\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Glowing Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Glowing Wand (2,050 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Sustain Duel build for Joy.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy#build-exp-sustain-duel\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Sustain Duel build for Joy.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy#build-exp-sustain-duel\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/joy\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":118,\"name\":\"Joy\",\"slug\":\"joy\",\"title\":\"Pirate Fairy\",\"role\":[\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Chase\",\"Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":3,\"releaseYear\":2022,\"stats\":{\"durability\":30,\"offense\":70,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":90},\"winRate\":49.33,\"pickRate\":0.13,\"banRate\":0.19,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"xavier\",\"heroName\":\"Xavier\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Joy is strong against heroes that lack mobility or rely on CC, like Xavier and Vexana, because she has an easier time hitting them with her 2nd Skill while being immune to their CC's.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"vexana\",\"heroName\":\"Vexana\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Joy is strong against heroes that lack mobility or rely on CC, like Xavier and Vexana, because she has an easier time hitting them with her 2nd Skill while being immune to their CC's.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"minsitthar\",\"heroName\":\"Minsitthar\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Joy is countered by heroes that can restrict mobility skills, such as Minsitthar and Khufra, due to her kit's heavy reliance on her 2nd Skill.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"khufra\",\"heroName\":\"Khufra\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Joy is countered by heroes that can restrict mobility skills, such as Minsitthar and Khufra, due to her kit's heavy reliance on her 2nd Skill.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_f647bf6dbb80b4b2b2310ab5af88773d.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d3a3a55c22000ae78732fed8cba2efef.png\",\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Humph, Joy's Angry!\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Joy becomes Angry! each time her skill hits a non-Minion enemy, dealing 100 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and increasing her Movement Speed by 60% that decays over 4s (hitting the Leonin Crystal will also grant the Movement Speed effect). This effect has a cooldown of 4s for each target.\\n\\nJoy's Basic Attack will deal 65 (+65% Total Physical Attack) (+65% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Joy becomes \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Angry!\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" each time her skill hits a non-Minion enemy, dealing 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and increasing her Movement Speed by 60% that decays over 4s (hitting the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Leonin Crystal\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" will also grant the Movement Speed effect). This effect has a cooldown of 4s for each target.\\n\\nJoy's Basic Attack will deal 65\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+65% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+65% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2e3f79d1e66691e8d89cacca211ed231.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\",\"Speed Up\"]},{\"name\":\"Look, Leonin Crystal!\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Joy summons a Leonin Crystal at the target location, dealing 200 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies and slowing them by 30% for 1s. The Leonin Crystal lasts up to 2s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Joy summons a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Leonin Crystal\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" at the target location, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to nearby enemies and slowing them by 30% for 1s. The \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Leonin Crystal\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" lasts up to 2s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"4s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_608b4796b7497e4552f9785a3d4331db.png\",\"tags\":[\"Summon\"]},{\"name\":\"Meow, Rhythm of Joy!\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Joy dashes in the target direction, dealing 120 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in her path. Hitting an enemy or the Leonin Crystal allows Joy to cast this skill again within 0.8s and gain 1 Beat Energy. Casting this skill on the beat increases the skill damage by 100% and grants a 80 (+60% Total Magic Power) shield that lasts 3s.\\n\\nThis skill can be cast up to 4 times in succession.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Joy dashes in the target direction, dealing 120\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies in her path. Hitting an enemy or the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Leonin Crystal\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" allows Joy to cast this skill again within 0.8s and gain 1 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Beat Energy\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Casting this skill on the beat increases the skill damage by 100% and grants a 80\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" shield that lasts 3s.\\n\\nThis skill can be cast up to 4 times in succession.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"0.132s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a500868582b10eec96f338ed3922d3eb.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Ha, Electrifying Beats!\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Joy gains 15 (+10% Total Magic Power) Hybrid Defense and 30% Movement Speed. Over the next 3s, she pulses 8 times, dealing 120 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage each time to nearby enemies.\\nEach Meow, Rhythm of Joy! cast on the beat increases this skill's damage by 40%. If perfect rhythm is achieved by hitting every beat with Meow, Rhythm of Joy!, Joy also gains 40% Spell Vamp while this skill is active.\\n\\nThis skill unlocks when Joy acquires Beat Energy. Casting this skill with 3 Beat Energy will remove all debuffs and make her immune to slow effects while this skill is active.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Joy gains 15\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+10% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Hybrid Defense and 30% Movement Speed. Over the next 3s, she pulses 8 times, dealing 120\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage each time to nearby enemies.\\nEach \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Meow, Rhythm of Joy!\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" cast on the beat increases this skill's damage by 40%. If perfect rhythm is achieved by hitting every beat with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Meow, Rhythm of Joy!\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", Joy also gains 40% Spell Vamp while this skill is active.\\n\\nThis skill unlocks when Joy acquires \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Beat Energy\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Casting this skill with 3 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Beat Energy\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" will remove all debuffs and make her immune to slow effects while this skill is active.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d86ac1655ad1a2ec0b569fbec9abadda.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Speed Up\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"angela\",\"heroName\":\"Angela\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Joy works best with heroes with that can provide powerful support or have strong initiation, like Angela and Hylos.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hylos\",\"heroName\":\"Hylos\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Joy works best with heroes with that can provide powerful support or have strong initiation, like Angela and Hylos.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, Joy should summon a Leonin Crystal with her 1st Skill and use it as a springboard for her 2nd Skill to enter the battle. Continue to chain her 2nd Skill on the beat to unlock her Ultimate. Finally, use her Ultimate to finish off the enemy.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_608b4796b7497e4552f9785a3d4331db.png\"},{\"skillId\":11820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a500868582b10eec96f338ed3922d3eb.png\"},{\"skillId\":11830,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d86ac1655ad1a2ec0b569fbec9abadda.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Joy should place her 1st Skill on top of the enemy, then use her 2nd Skill to dash through both targets and continue to chain her 2nd Skill on the beat for damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_608b4796b7497e4552f9785a3d4331db.png\"},{\"skillId\":11820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a500868582b10eec96f338ed3922d3eb.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Joy build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Beat Energy combos, Genius Wand power spike, dash punishers like Phoveus, when she is a trap pick.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Joy is the highest-skill assassin in the roster after Fanny, and she punishes you for picking her into the wrong draft harder than almost any other hero. The game does not let you brute-force her: every fight is a rhythm test, and missing a beat costs the kill.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"joy\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"jungle-pickoff-tempo\",\"name\":\"Jungle Pickoff Tempo\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"starlium-scythe\",\"name\":\"Starlium Scythe\",\"cost\":2220,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\",\"cost\":3000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divin